# maintenance.func

> Module: maintenance (Bakım Takvimi) | Category: FLEET

## Purpose
Maintenance scheduling and records for the vehicle fleet. Track all maintenance events per truck, set next-service reminders, and record costs. Critical for fleet reliability and legal compliance (periodic vehicle inspection is mandatory in Turkey).

## Problems It Solves
- Turkish law requires regular vehicle inspections (muayene, egzoz emisyon)
- Fleet owners need to track maintenance costs per vehicle
- Preventive maintenance scheduling prevents breakdowns
- Cost tracking enables TCO (Total Cost of Ownership) per truck

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `maintenance_records`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| arac_id | INTEGER FK | Linked to trucks.id |
| bakim_turu | bakim_turu_enum | Maintenance type |
| aciklama | TEXT | Description |
| tarih | DATE | Date performed |
| km | INTEGER | Odometer at service |
| tutar | DECIMAL(12,2) | Cost |
| sonraki_bakim_km | INTEGER | Next service km |
| sonraki_bakim_tarih | DATE | Next service date |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

**Enum:** `bakim_turu_enum` (12 types) — PERIYODIK_BAKIM, YAG_DEGISIMI, FREN_BAKIMI, LASTIK_DEGISIMI, MUAYENE, EGZOZ_EMISYON, ELEKTRIK_BAKIMI, KLIMA_BAKIMI, KAPORTA_BOYA, MOTOR_REVISION, SANZIMAN_BAKIMI, DIGER

## User Interface
**MaintenancePage.tsx** — `/dashboard/maintenance`
- DataGrid table: Araç, Bakım Türü, Tarih, KM, Tutar, Sonraki Bakım
- Add/Edit modal with truck selector, maintenance type dropdown, cost, next-service fields
- Delete with confirmation

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/maintenance/` | Tenant JWT | List maintenance records |
| POST | `/api/tenant/maintenance/` | Tenant JWT | Add record |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/maintenance/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Edit record |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/maintenance/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove record |

